@startuml
!include ../../../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/behavioral/statemachine-diagram-style.iuml
title Skill version lifecycle
[*] --> Candidate
Candidate --> Trial : gate
Trial --> PASSED : all checks pass
Trial --> FAILED : any check fails
PASSED --> Live : promote
Live --> Retired : retire
Retired --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
legend right
  Arrow: transition
  [guard]: condition
endlegend
@enduml
